280 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 182 0 R
/E (Bottom line: Adding deep supervision made FFLUNet a meaningfully better model overall, especially for the largest and most diffuse tumor region. The trade-off is a slightly harder training process and marginally weaker detection of the smallest tumor subregion.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
